# ============================================================================
# OncoPattern — .gitignore
# ESS-KS Life Tech · K-S (Kanishk-Soni)
# https://github.com/esskslifetech/OncoPattern
#
# What is tracked: the .tech sources, the retrieval and build tools, and the
# input datasets (including the real EPO and Europe PMC pulls, which are small
# and are what makes a run reproducible).
#
# What is ignored: everything the platform PRODUCES.  Every file below is
# regenerated by `tools/ocbuild run config/boot.tech oncopattern` and
# `tools/runtests`, so committing it would only create merge noise and bloat —
# results/ alone is ~9 MB per run, most of it uncompressed BMP framebuffers.
# ============================================================================

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- run output
# reports, journals, rendered frames, vector figures, test certificates
results/
out/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- build output
# linked source, bytecode, packaged binary, and the datasets copied beside it
dist/
build/
*.tbc
*.tbin
*.techbin

# ------------------------------------------------------------- staging leaks
# tools/ocbuild stages the tree into the TECH root and removes it again; these
# only appear if a build is interrupted before its cleanup trap runs
/oncopattern/ocout/
/ocdata/
/ocout/

# --------------------------------------------------------- rendered rasters
# the platform writes BMP/PPM; tools/bmp2png.py converts them for previewing.
# Both are outputs — the SVG and PNG in a README should be added deliberately.
*.bmp
*.ppm
results/*.png

# ------------------------------------------------------- filesystem images
# the journaling volume written through stdlib/fs.tech
*.tfs

# ------------------------------------------------------------------ scratch
# language-probe programs are tracked as evidence, but their compiled output
# and any ad-hoc experiment files are not
scratch/*.tbc
scratch/*.tbin
scratch/raw.bin
scratch/linked.tech
oncopattern/test/t_*.tech
!oncopattern/test/t_cross.tech

# ------------------------------------------------------------------- python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/

# -------------------------------------------------------------------- editor
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------- misc
*.log
*.tmp
/tmp/
node_modules/
